# PROJECT: SR2B PEST CONTROL — PROFESSIONAL BUSINESS WEBSITE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, conversion optimization specialist, and software architect.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, modern, responsive, production-ready website for a pest control business named **SR2B Pest Control**.

This must be a functioning website, not just a static design or a landing-page mockup.

The website must include an easy-to-use **Config button** that opens a configuration dashboard. This dashboard must allow the business owner to customize the website's business information, contact details, services, pricing, branding, and other important content without manually editing source code.

Prioritize a premium visual design, customer trust, mobile usability, lead generation, maintainable code, and straightforward business management.

Do not stop after generating a homepage. Build all the required pages, interactions, configuration functionality, and supporting components.

